perational; and both managed nodes passed the full restart-evidence protocol with lifecycle-confirmed boot changes.","limitations":["The server-generated EXTENDED CHECKSUM values differ across the MariaDB 10.0 and 10.11 servers for three tables, and the capture does not establish the implementation-specific reason. Exact canonical SQL-result hashes, row counts, totals, and integrity checks match, so this does not demonstrate a data mismatch (cmd-79abd54c9d7145f9, cmd-22a947825a834f31, cmd-b481033aa8334af3, cmd-c050ca67103a4254).","Some verbose detailed-metadata output was bounded and truncated, although the final complete metadata-query SHA-256 matches directly across both nodes (cmd-5d4a8cc1465b4889, cmd-94e33dcea9734d53)."]}
